  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">222553_FY24 #7_UNHCR_DRC_N&amp;S Ubangi WASH ED &amp; Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education;

(i)  School infrastructures Constructed to Support for quality, inclusive and equitable education.

WASH;

(ii) All PoC Households have access to adequate sanitation facilities including community sanitation infrastructure;

-Community solid waste management systems improved (including recycling systems ;

-Construction of water points within a radius of less than 200 metres from each household ;

-Water storage capacity at household level increased to at least 50 litres per household.

 

Resilience;

(iii) Resilience building and self-employment opportunities are offered to the persons of refugees and asylum seekers

Protection;

(iv) Improved protection for vulnerable refugees and their host communities</narrative>
  </description>
